<event name="FUEL_ESCAPE_FLEET">
	<text>[ Fuel escape (Rebel fleet) ]

Your pilot deftly avoids the artillery fire from the surrounding fleet while you try to sort out exactly what your plan is....</text>
</event>

<event name="FUEL_ESCAPE_PDS">
	<text>[ Fuel escape (planetary defence) ]

Using your impulse engines, you were able to pull to a safe distance from the hostile planet.</text>
</event>

<event name="FUEL_ESCAPE_PULSAR">
	<text>[ Fuel escape (pulsar) ]

Taking advantage of the last of your fuel reserves, you were able to navigate to a safe distance from the pulsar.</text>
</event>

<textList name="EVLBL_PIRATE_PULSAR">
	<text>[ Pirate fight near pulsar ]

Sensors go wild as a nearby pulsar is detected. While you are attempting to recalibrate the FTL drive, a pirate sneaks up on your ship, weapons charging. Prepare for a fight!</text>
	<text>[ Pirate fight near pulsar ]

You arrive to find a pulsar dominating the view screen. You see a small silhouette pass in front of the star. Before you can ponder what it is, warning signals go off. It appears to be a ship in a firing trajectory!</text>
	<text>[ Pirate fight near pulsar ]

A small research station orbits a nearby pulsar. It appears largely abandoned, but you detect power signatures flaring up as soon as you're in scanning distance. A small combat ship launches from the station. Pirates!</text>
	<text>[ Pirate fight near pulsar ]

Sensors go wild as a nearby pulsar is detected. While you are attempting to recalibrate the FTL drive, a pirate sneaks up on your ship, weapons charging. Prepare for a fight!</text>
	<text>[ Pirate fight near pulsar ]

You arrive to find a pulsar dominating the view screen. You see a small silhouette pass in front of the star. Before you can ponder what it is, warning signals go off. It appears to be a ship in a firing trajectory!</text>
	<text>[ Pirate fight near pulsar ]

A small research station orbits a nearby pulsar. It appears largely abandoned, but you detect power signatures flaring up as soon as you're in scanning distance. A small combat ship launches from the station. Pirates!</text>
</textList>

<event name="PIRATE_PULSAR" unique="true">
	<text load="EVLBL_PIRATE_PULSAR"/>
	<ship load="PIRATE" hostile="true"/>
	<environment type="pulsar"/>
</event>

<textList name="EVLBL_REBEL_AUTO_PDS">
	<text>[ Rebel auto-ship fight with hostile ASB ]

As soon as you arrive multiple warnings go off. A hostile automated ship is detected and an Anti-Ship Battery begins firing. This doesn't look good!</text>
	<text>[ Rebel auto-ship fight with hostile ASB ]

As soon as you arrive multiple warnings go off. A hostile automated ship is detected and an Anti-Ship Battery begins firing. This doesn't look good!</text>
	<text>[ Rebel auto-ship fight with hostile ASB ]

As soon as you arrive multiple warnings go off. A hostile automated ship is detected and an Anti-Ship Battery begins firing. This doesn't look good!</text>
	<text>[ Rebel auto-ship fight with hostile ASB ]

As soon as you arrive multiple warnings go off. A hostile automated ship is detected and an Anti-Ship Battery begins firing. This doesn't look good!</text>
</textList>

<event name="REBEL_AUTO_PDS" unique="true">
	<text load="EVLBL_REBEL_AUTO_PDS"/>
	<environment type="PDS" target="player"/>
	<ship load="REBEL_AUTO" hostile="true"/>
	<choice>
		<text id="event_REBEL_AUTO_PDS_c1_choice"/>
		<event/>
	</choice>
	<choice req="hacking" lvl="1">
		<text id="event_REBEL_AUTO_PDS_c2_choice"/>
		<event>
			<text id="event_REBEL_AUTO_PDS_c2_text"/>
			<environment type="PDS" target="all"/>
			<item_modify>
				<item type="drones" min="-1" max="-1"/>
			</item_modify>
		</event>
	</choice>
	<choice req="hacking" lvl="3">
		<text id="event_REBEL_AUTO_PDS_c3_choice"/>
		<event>
			<text id="event_REBEL_AUTO_PDS_c3_text"/>
			<environment type="PDS" target="enemy"/>
			<item_modify>
				<item type="drones" min="-1" max="-1"/>
			</item_modify>
		</event>
	</choice>
</event>

<textList name="EVLBL_REBEL_PULSAR">
	<text>[ Rebel fight near pulsar ]

A Rebel captain appears on the screen. "I thought we had been doomed to backwater assignments. This is my chance to get back in Command's good graces! Charge the weapons!"</text>
	<text>[ Rebel fight near pulsar ]

A small rebel research station overlooks a pulsating star. Before you can react a Rebel ship spots you and moves in to attack.</text>
	<text>[ Rebel fight near pulsar ]

You arrive at an infrequently used beacon close to a pulsar. Before long a Rebel ship happens to jump nearby. Looks like you'll have to fight.</text>
	<text>[ Rebel fight near pulsar ]

A Rebel captain appears on the screen. "I thought we had been doomed to backwater assignments. This is my chance to get back in Command's good graces! Charge the weapons!"</text>
	<text>[ Rebel fight near pulsar ]

A small rebel research station overlooks a pulsating star. Before you can react a Rebel ship spots you and moves in to attack.</text>
	<text>[ Rebel fight near pulsar ]

You arrive at an infrequently used beacon close to a pulsar. Before long a Rebel ship happens to jump nearby. Looks like you'll have to fight.</text>
</textList>

<event name="REBEL_PULSAR" unique="true">
	<text load="EVLBL_REBEL_PULSAR"/>
	<ship load="REBEL" hostile="true"/>
	<environment type="pulsar"/>
</event>

